<title>USA: REX Stores to buy back 500,000 more shares.</title>
<headline>REX Stores to buy back 500,000 more shares.</headline>
<dateline>DAYTON, Ohio 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>REX Stores Corp said Thursday it had authorized a buyback of up to 500,000 shares in excess of prior authorizations.</p>
<p>The company said it had purchased 375,000 shares after the end of its fiscal year, in additon to the previously announced purchase of 854,000 shares during the 12 months ended January 31, 1997.</p>
<p>REX said it now has 7,839,731 common shares outstanding.</p>
